title: "Email Manager — AI 邮件管理助手"
abstract: "An AI email assistant that sorts an Outlook inbox into S/A/B/C and emails a summary report, built for HKUST students. It talks to Microsoft Graph directly, so desktop Outlook is not required. / 面向香港科技大学（HKUST）学生的 Outlook 收件箱自动分级（S/A/B/C）与总结工具。直接对接 Microsoft Graph，不需要安装桌面版 Outlook。"
